# Chat: your rooms, a room's messages, answering one, and searching every
# room. The people and rooms are made up, on a Tuwunel of the recording's
# own (record.sh's start_chat), which the demo signs in to unseen.
# command: greed chat
# needs: chat
size 1280 800
fps 30
typing 0.03
show-keys
hide
run chat-login
wait 0.5
type matrix
keys enter
wait 0.3
type {matrix}
keys enter
wait-for Password
keys enter
wait 0.3
type sam
keys enter
wait 0.3
type demo
keys enter
wait-for Garden club
wait 12
keys j
wait 0.3
show
wait 0.6

caption Your rooms, those that mention you first
wait 2.5

caption A room's messages, kept up to date as they come
keys enter
wait-for plant labels
wait 2.5

caption Answering a message
keys k k k
wait 0.4
keys alt-r
wait 0.3
keys i
type Sure, I'll bring them
wait 0.3
keys enter
wait-for ↳ Jonas
wait 2.5
shot chat
keys esc
wait 0.5

caption Searching every room
keys q
wait 0.6
keys /
type deploy
wait 1.5
keys enter
wait-for deploy went out
wait 1.5
keys enter
wait-for restarted twice
wait 2.5
